      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "This feeling of total disillusionment and the belief that your entire existence was built on a lie is known as nihilism, and it can be an incredibly isolating and heavy burden to carry. While it feels like a dead end, human resilience often thrives precisely when old narratives fail, even if the path forward seems completely obscured in the dark. You are not alone in facing this void, and many who have felt this way describe the subsequent struggle as the beginning of a more authentic life, even if it takes a long time to find it.",
